  "contentHtml": "<p>6월 초에 찍은 태양 사진들 올려봅니다.&#160;</p><p>계획은 매일매일 찍어서 흑점의 이동을 통해 태양의 자전을 확인해보고 싶었는데 날씨가 도와주질 않네요 ㅠ&#160;</p><p>부족하지만 한번 올려봅니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>망원경 : solar scout 60ds</p><p>가대 : sky watcher eq5&#160;</p><p>카메라 : zwo asi 533mc</p><p>촬영정보 : gain 100, 노출시간 5~8ms, 100frame or 1분</p><p>장소 : 학교 옥상</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ddf9aa1ee5a5a08b470212241f3b3d73a043793\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ddf9aa1ee5a5a08b470212241f3b3d73a043793\" data-origin-width=\"1900\" data-origin-height=\"372\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bbb0674e10018b092dc3dea2fb29963d119110f3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bbb0674e10018b092dc3dea2fb29963d119110f3\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3064\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2023.06.09.태양</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0ed5b223f661debd8b82287db7e78d83fcee46e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0ed5b223f661debd8b82287db7e78d83fcee46e\" data-origin-width=\"3016\" data-origin-height=\"3016\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2023.06.12.태양</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06ea994c747e6263cf46369e873c2bd84ca208cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06ea994c747e6263cf46369e873c2bd84ca208cf\" data-origin-width=\"3016\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2023.06.13.태양</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d80ff990b25924dcad4fc24bb66baaac38ed7622\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d80ff990b25924dcad4fc24bb66baaac38ed7622\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3056\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2023.06.14.태양</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/844d1febc3d4350f8d69a055c082d3aa8eaa873a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/844d1febc3d4350f8d69a055c082d3aa8eaa873a\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2023.06.16.태양</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f7e700e13579f6c5b02fa0e876152f8c8889924\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f7e700e13579f6c5b02fa0e876152f8c8889924\" data-origin-width=\"3016\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"><div class=\"figcaption\">2023.06.23.태양</div></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
